  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: After seemingly defeating the bears, Natsuki looks over them for a few
      seconds to make sure they're really dead.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515732
    - rid: 4351268279254515733
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (... alright. Bears down...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515734
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With the coast seemingly clear, Natsuki sits down to rest after her hard-fought
      battle.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515736
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaaahh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515737
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515738
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (... did I seriously just take down two bears all by myself?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ha!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515739
    - rid: 4351268279254515745
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Take that, weird black-armor man!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515740
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait 'til the others hear about this, they're gonna be so surprised!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515741
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I should probably also ask about the weird gem I got when I get back.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515742
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki has been resting for a few more minutes to recuperate.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515743
    - rid: 4351268279254515744
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With her rest finished, Natsuki gets up and starts heading back to Jorrvaskr
      to get paid.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515746
    - rid: 4351268279254515747
    - rid: 4351268279254515748
